e heard.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81110/5364063.jpg"},{"title":"Flames of the Final Farewell","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11176","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21287","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30549","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42836","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[17]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81110","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[17]}],"link":"89359","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Flames of the Final Farewell","titleLanguage":"eng"}},"thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81110/5380025.jpg"},{"title":"Layering Sins Upon Sins","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11176","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21287","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30549","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42836","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[18]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81110","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[18]}],"link":"89358","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Layering Sins Upon Sins","synopsis":"As Canon continues to fight alone in Dreizehn, for just a moment, she glimpses a faint hope for the future. Her mother can only watch from outside, unaware of her daughter's battle to grasp that hope. Meanwhile, Sui's father discovers the link between Sui's SDP and the good luck charm that his sister had left behind.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"As Canon continues to fight alone in Dreizehn, for just a moment, she glimpses a faint hope for the future. Her mother can only watch from outside, unaware of her daughter's battle to grasp that hope. Meanwhile, Sui's father discovers the link between Sui's SDP and the good luck charm that his sister had left behind.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81110/5381665.jpg"},{"title":"The Oath of the Living","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11176","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21287","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30549","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42836","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[19]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81110","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[19]}],"link":"89361","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"The Oath of the Living","synopsis":"The actions of the Human Army send a shock through everyone in the camp. Wounded and desperate for salvation, everyone's true feelings begin to spill forth. Meanwhile, flight from Tatsumiyajima is still impossible and effects on the island ecosystem have grown severe. Their sights turn toward devising an escape, and Alvis depends on the Fafners' SDPs to break free of the current crisis. On top of everything, the pilots' new assimilation phenomena continue to worsen...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"The actions of the Human Army send a shock through everyone in the camp. Wounded and desperate for salvation, everyone's true feelings begin to spill forth. Meanwhile, flight from Tatsumiyajima is still impossible and effects on the island ecosystem have grown severe. Their sights turn toward devising an escape, and Alvis depends on the Fafners' SDPs to break free of the current crisis. On top of everything, the pilots' new assimilation phenomena continue to worsen...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81110/5388461.jpg"},{"title":"The Soldiers Return Home","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11176","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21287","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30549","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42836","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[20]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81110","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[20]}],"link":"89360","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"The Soldiers Return Home","synopsis":"The escape plan is in motion, but quickly faces a crisis. The fangs of the giant Festum that holds Alvis in its clutches sink in deeper and deeper, and Welle Shield 1 is destroyed, with Welle Shield 2 in imminent danger. Orihime endures the pain silently, but as he watches her, Fumihiko secretly makes the decision to enact the next plan. Meanwhile, Kenji and Sui witness something that shouldn't be possible...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"The escape plan is in motion, but quickly faces a crisis. The fangs of the giant Festum that holds Alvis in its clutches sink in deeper and deeper, and Welle Shield 1 is destroyed, with Welle Shield 2 in imminent danger. Orihime endures the pain silently, but as he watches her, Fumihiko secretly makes the decision to enact the next plan. Meanwhile, Kenji and Sui witness something that shouldn't be possible...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81110/5400548.jpg"},{"title":"Time of Awakening","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11176","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21287","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30549","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42836","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[21]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81110","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[21]}],"link":"89362","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Time of Awakening","synopsis":"Narain's party has arrived at the next camp, located in a that lost the majority of its land in battle. They fish in the adjacent sea, replenish their supplies, and indulge in a brief rest. Maya offers flowers to the ocean in memory of Shouko's birthday, and remembers that the next day is Kazuki's birthday, a connection she once thought of as strange. Meanwhile, the top brass at the Neo UN orders the use of something they've been developing in secret to finish Narain's forces once and for all.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Narain's party has arrived at the next camp, located in a that lost the majority of its land in battle. They fish in the adjacent sea, replenish their supplies, and indulge in a brief rest. Maya offers flowers to the ocean in memory of Shouko's birthday, and remembers that the next day is Kazuki's birthday, a connection she once thought of as strange. Meanwhile, the top brass at the Neo UN orders the use of something they've been developing in secret to finish Narain's forces once and for all.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81110/5401435.jpg"},{"title":"Memories of Hatred","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11176","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21287","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30549","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42836","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81110","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[22]}],"link":"89363","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Memories of Hatred","synopsis":"Narain's party successfully reaches Tatsumiyajima, but the enemy awaits them there. They struggle as both a huge Festum swarm and the Human Army surround them, but Soushi insists reinforcements are coming. The Fafner unit arriving from the island tries to avoid fighting the Human Army and uphold Fumihiko's wish to not fight with other humans, but the Argos platoon pursues them with orders to capture an island Fafner.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"Narain's party successfully reaches Tatsumiyajima, but the enemy awaits them there. They struggle as both a huge Festum swarm and the Human Army surround them, but Soushi insists reinforcements are coming. The Fafner unit arriving from the island tries to avoid fighting the Human Army and uphold Fumihiko's wish to not fight with other humans, but the Argos platoon pursues them with orders to capture an island Fafner.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81110/5411210.jpg"},{"title":"Power Without Reason","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11176","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21287","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30549","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42836","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81110","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[23]}],"link":"89364","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"Power Without Reason","synopsis":"The Neo UN agrees to the terms proposed by the top brass of Alvis for the return of the latter's prisoners of war. At the same time, Hester Gallop is informed that the new Fafner under development by the Neo UN is in experimental stages. Memories from her youth, when she first established the Neo UN, flash through Hester's mind; she has her own convictions and things she wishes to protect. However, certain personnel within the Neo UN have contacted Tatsumiyajima with plans of their own...","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"The Neo UN agrees to the terms proposed by the top brass of Alvis for the return of the latter's prisoners of war. At the same time, Hester Gallop is informed that the new Fafner under development by the Neo UN is in experimental stages. Memories from her youth, when she first established the Neo UN, flash through Hester's mind; she has her own convictions and things she wishes to protect. However, certain personnel within the Neo UN have contacted Tatsumiyajima with plans of their own...","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81110/5427625.jpg"},{"title":"The Third Alvis","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"11176","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"21287","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"30549","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42836","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[24]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"81110","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[24]}],"link":"89365","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{},"tvdb":{"title":"The Third Alvis","synopsis":"The Alvis top brass are searching for the place the Esperantos chose for the new settlement. There's a chance it may be occupied by the enemy, but out of respect to the Esperantos' wishes, they're determined to take it back if that is the case. Meanwhile, in the Tatsumiyajima burg, progress is being made with the improvement of the Zero Fafner. Siblings Rina and Akira are chosen yet again to pilot it, as their SDPs are expected to work in synergy with the Zero Fafner's power.","titleLanguage":"eng","synopsisLanguage":"eng"}},"synopsis":"The Alvis top brass are searching for the place the Esperantos chose for the new settlement. There's a chance it may be occupied by the enemy, but out of respect to the Esperantos' wishes, they're determined to take it back if that is the case. Meanwhile, in the Tatsumiyajima burg, progress is being made with the improvement of the Zero Fafner. Siblings Rina and Akira are chosen yet again to pilot it, as their SDPs are expected to work in synergy with the Zero Fafner's power.","thumbnail":"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/81110/5433541.jpg"},{"title":"Operation Azure","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"e